* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/sʌˈblɪmɪn(ə)l/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-subliminal.ogg|Audio (GA)}}
* {{hyphenation|en|sub|li|min|al}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{lb|en|physiology}} Of a [[stimulus]]: [[below#Preposition|below]] the [[limen]] or [[threshold]] of [[conscious]] [[perception]], especially if still [[able#Adjective|able]] to [[produce#Verb|produce]] a [[response]]; also {{lb|en|generally}}, below the threshold where a response can be produced. {{defdate|from late 19th c.}}
#: {{synonyms|en|latent|underthreshold}}
#: {{antonyms|en|superliminal}}
# {{lb|en|psychology}} Without [[directed#Adjective|directed]] [[awareness]] or [[thought#Noun|thought]]; [[subconscious#Adjective|subconscious]] {{qualifier|dated}}, [[unconscious#Adjective|unconscious]]. {{defdate|from late 19th c.}}
# {{lb|en|by extension}} Of an [[advertisement]], a [[message#Noun|message]], etc.: [[convey]]ed in a [[manner#Noun|manner]] that a [[person#Noun|person]] is [[unaware]] of being [[influence#Verb|influenced]] by it. {{defdate|from mid 20th c.}}

